    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "화물의 운송, 보관, 하역, 배송, 물류시설과 물류흐름에 관한 데이터."@ko, "Data about freight transport, storage, handling, delivery, logistics facilities and freight flows."@en;
