<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/network-element-type/node> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "교통망에서 링크의 시작·종료 또는 연결 지점을 식별하는 요소."@ko, "An element identifying the start, end or connection point of links in a transport network."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/network-element-type>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "노드"@ko, "Node"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/network-element-type>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/network-element-type/link> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "교통망의 두 노드 사이에서 이동 가능한 연결을 나타내는 방향성 또는 비방향성 요소."@ko, "A directed or undirected element representing a traversable connection between two network nodes."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/network-element-type>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "링크"@ko, "Link"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/network-element-type>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/network-element-type/section> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "운영, 관리 또는 분석 목적으로 하나 이상의 연속 링크를 묶은 망 요소."@ko, "A network element grouping one or more consecutive links for operational, management or analytical purposes."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/network-element-type>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "구간"@ko, "Section"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/network-element-type>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/network-element-type/station> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "철도 또는 도시철도에서 승하차, 환승이나 운영 기능을 제공하는 장소."@ko, "A place providing boarding, alighting, interchange or operational functions for rail services."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/network-element-type>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "역"@ko, "Station"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/network-element-type>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/network-element-type/stop> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "버스, 노면전차 또는 그 밖의 교통서비스가 승하차를 위해 정차하는 지정 장소."@ko, "A designated place where a bus, tram or other transport service stops for boarding and alighting."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/network-element-type>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "정류장"@ko, "Stop"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/network-element-type>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/network-element-type/facility> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "교통망의 건설, 운영, 이용 또는 안전을 지원하는 물리적 시설."@ko, "A physical facility supporting construction, operation, use or safety of a transport network."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/network-element-type>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "시설"@ko, "Facility"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/network-element-type>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/network-element-type/zone> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "교통수요, 통행 또는 서비스 범위를 집계하기 위해 설정한 공간 단위."@ko, "A spatial unit defined for aggregating transport demand, trips or service coverage."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/network-element-type>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "교통 존"@ko, "Transport zone"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/network-element-type>.
