    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "승인된 품질 평가 절차를 아직 실행하지 않은 상태."@ko, "No approved quality-assessment procedure has yet been run."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-status>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "미평가"@ko, "Not assessed"@en;
