    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "평가 완료"@ko, "Assessed"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-status>.
<https://data.molit.go.kr/id/concept/quality-status/warning> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "평가가 완료됐으나 하나 이상의 측정항목에 검토가 필요한 상태."@ko, "Assessment is complete, but one or more metrics require review."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-status>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "주의"@ko, "Warning"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://data.molit.go.kr/scheme/quality-status>.
